# For local testing, copy this to .streamlit/secrets.toml (already gitignored
# by convention -- do not commit your real key).
#
# On Streamlit Community Cloud: go to your app -> Settings -> Secrets, and
# paste the same content there instead. This keeps your API key out of the
# public GitHub repo entirely.

